@QueryService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5135
@token = paste-access-token-here
@groupId = paste-group-guid-here

### Public group search
GET {{QueryService_HostAddress}}/api/groups?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Public group details
GET {{QueryService_HostAddress}}/api/groups/{{groupId}}
Accept: application/json

### Owner-only pending requests
GET {{QueryService_HostAddress}}/api/groups/{{groupId}}/join-requests?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
